  "visual_differences": [
    "All panels use the existing Godot fonts, panel edges and button widths. The slightly wider greeting shifts the next two buttons right. Every locked paragraph stays on a single line. rm17 has no memory row.",
    "All captures use Thursday 10:00 with 198 coins and trust 45, as pictured. Thursday day 36 shows 7 Ramadan in the live HUD instead of the masters' 1 Sha'ban and has a wider date card.",
    "The native camera shows existing placeholder geometry, capsules and labels. rm01–05 show Spice Row and Rashid, rm06–08 the Task Board and Salma, rm09/10/17 Weaver's Lane and Layla, and rm14–16 Market Scales and Old Musa. rm11–13 show Jamal and a sunlit quay, while the masters show a moonlit quay. rm12's quay shadows differ slightly from rm11 and rm13."
